+# Pet clinic
+
+The clinic's reception keeps a record of owners, their pets and the pets' visits.
+
+## Language
+
+**Microchip number**:
+The 15-digit ISO 11784 number read from the microchip implanted in a pet.
+_Avoid_: Chip number, chip ID, transponder
